sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant B as Browser (HostedTransport)
  participant C as /api/v1/chat
  participant L as LiteLLM proxy
  participant S as /api/v1/search
  participant P as /api/chat/sessions
  U->>B: prompt
  B->>P: append user message
  loop tool loop (≤ 40 rounds)
    B->>C: POST {model, messages, tools:[web_search]}
    C->>C: session → decrypt sk-fabric key
    C->>L: chat/completions (stream)
    L-->>C: SSE
    C-->>B: SSE (key never leaves server)
    alt assistant returns tool_call web_search
      B->>B: permission matrix (read-only → allow)
      B->>S: POST /api/v1/search {query}
      S-->>B: results
      B->>B: emit tool-call / tool-result SessionEvents
    else assistant returns text
      B->>B: emit delta SessionEvents (word-paced reveal)
    end
  end
  B->>P: append assistant message
